WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.020
What is 3 divided by 100?

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:07.160
Dividing by 10 slides every digit one seat right.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.500
Do it again for 100.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.530
Now the 3 sits in the hundredths seat, two seats right of the ones.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:17.130
Zeros fill the empty seats in front of it.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:21.013
3 divided by 100 is 0.03.
